    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On April 27, 2026, pursuant to Section 3(b) of the reporting person's Amended and Restated Executive Employment Agreement, the issuer agreed to grant the reporting person restricted stock units (&quot;RSUs&quot;), each representing a contingent right to receive one share of common stock upon vesting and having no expiration date, under the issuer's 2025 Incentive Compensation Plan as an annual bonus award. The number of RSUs was determined by dividing $1,200,000 by the April 27, 2026 closing price ($15.20), rounded down to the nearest whole share, and confirmed by resolution of the issuer's Board of Directors adopted September 23, 2026. The grant of the RSUs was previously reported on the reporting person's Form 4 filed on October 2, 2026. The RSUs vest in four substantially equal quarterly installments (19,737 RSUs on each of July 27, 2026, October 27, 2026 and January 27, 2027, and 19,736 RSUs on April 27, 2027), subject to continued employment on each vesting date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Represents the second quarterly vesting of the RSUs described in footnote 1, which vested on October 27, 2026. Each RSU was settled in one share of common stock for no consideration.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Consists of 1,412,855 shares of common stock held of record by SMSC Capital Holdings LLC (&quot;SMSC&quot;), previously reported on the reporting person's Form 3 filed April 29, 2026. The reporting person owns a 1% membership interest in SMSC, and the David E. Halabu Irrevocable Trust, for which the reporting person acts as trustee, owns the remaining 99% membership interest in SMSC. The reporting person disclaims beneficial ownership of the shares held by SMSC except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">Represents 12,576 shares of common stock received by Naneva Capital LLC (&quot;Naneva&quot;) on April 30, 2026 in a pro rata distribution, for no consideration, by BSG Series CM, LLC (&quot;BSG&quot;) of all shares of common stock of the issuer held by BSG to its members in accordance with their respective percentage membership interests. The reporting person owns a 90% membership interest in Naneva, and the reporting person's spouse owns the remaining 10% membership interest in Naneva. The reporting person disclaims beneficial ownership of the shares held by Naneva except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

    <remarks>The shares of common stock reported in Table I as acquired upon settlement of restricted stock units were issued under the issuer's registration statement on Form S-8 filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on August 21, 2026. The acquisition of 12,576 shares of common stock by Naneva Capital LLC on April 30, 2026 reported in Table I was inadvertently not reported on a timely basis, and those shares were inadvertently omitted from the holdings reported on the reporting person's Form 4 filed October 2, 2026.</remarks>

